# 36. Important pip commands cheat sheet

| Command                                     | Purpose                               |
| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| `python -m pip --version`                   | Check pip version                     |
| `python -m pip install package`             | Install package                       |
| `python -m pip install package==1.0`        | Install specific version              |
| `python -m pip install --upgrade package`   | Upgrade package                       |
| `python -m pip uninstall package`           | Remove package                        |
| `python -m pip list`                        | List installed packages               |
| `python -m pip show package`                | Show package information              |
| `python -m pip list --outdated`             | Show outdated packages                |
| `python -m pip freeze`                      | Show installed packages with versions |
| `python -m pip freeze > requirements.txt`   | Create requirements file              |
| `python -m pip install -r requirements.txt` | Install requirements                  |
| `python -m pip check`                       | Check for dependency problems         |

